{"answer_markdown": "To make OCR return tables as separate structured output instead of inline markdown, set the `table_format` parameter to either `"markdown"` or `"html"`. This will return tables separately in the `tables` field of the response, rather than inline in the markdown content [1].

Example request snippet:
```json
{
  "table_format": "html"
